#40400
The Guard Room~
   This dimly lit chamber houses the guards that are assigned to keep an eye on
those interred without.  Several stools surround a table laden with dice, small
change and food, while hooks and pegs set into the wall between smoldering
brands support cloaks, capes, satchels, vests and furs.  Kegs of wine, mead and
spirits lie scattered about the floor, evidence of the ample amounts of free
time these fellows have.  A loose stone on the floor near the east wall appears
to have been dislodged by a careless giant.    
~
