#40401
A Blackened Chamber~
   Not a single whisper of illumination penetrates the darkness that cloaks
this room in shadow, it is impossible to proceed without moving very slowly so
as to avoid barking one's shins on the many items of furniture that clutter the
chamber.  A foul smell, of vermin, fills the chamber, adding to the unease
created by the darkness.    
