#40402
A Narrow Corridor~
   Howls and shrieks echo from the west, sending shivers up and down your spine
as you proceed through this corridor that links whatever foul fate lurks there
with a junction to the east.  A single cell door lies to the north, containing
those who are due to be sacrificed to the dark gods soonest.  Shadows flicker
and dance on the wall, made by the mass of tentacles to the west that shifts in
the flickering torchlight.    
