#40404
The Temple of the Eye~
   Shifting, swirling patterns of light, of purple, mauve, violet and lavender
shades, all coruscate throughout this chamber, making it impossible to
accurately determine its function or dimensions.  The ground and walls appear
to shift as you pass, morphing into several strange and curious shapes.  Globs
of purplish substance run down the walls, plopping onto the floor, where they
are quickly absorbed.  A massive mural covers the western wall.    
