#40410
A Rough Hewn Tunnel~
   The stairs descend to a rough hewn tunnel, that worms its way through the
rock of the volcano to the south.  This is the lowest level of the citadel,
closest to the lava bed, and the heat even here is almost unbearable.  It is
amazing that the giant's allies can stand to be in this lair.  The walls here
are deeply scored, doubtless by the claws of trolls, en route to various
assignments.  No light sources are present here, there are not even sconces set
in the walls.    
~
