#40411
A Cavernous Hall~
   Numerous passages meet here, stretching into the distance of the truly
mammoth natural cave system that exists beneath the citadel.  Clumps of
stalagmites and stalagtites obscure vision, making it hard to see what may lurk
in the shadows ahead.  No sounds can be heard, though this is not a comfort as
most subterranean denizens move very quietly through the underdark.    
