#40412
The Crimson Portal~
   This section of the caverns is dominated by a massive red portal, set in the
northern rock face, and covered in runes and symbols.  Thick red chains criss
cross its glowing surface, which radiates intense heat, making it impossible to
approach without suffering injury.  There does not appear to be a way to open
it, nor does there seem to be a really compelling reason to do so, the door
radiates evil as well as heat.  A roasted corpse, a gnoll perhaps, lies next to
the door, burned to a crisp when it attempted to broach the valve.  A faint
whispering, as of a thousand voices, echoes about the door, its source unclear.
  
~
