#40413
The Rock Pool~
   At this point a rock pool fills most of the corner of this cave, fed from
above by water, that drips down from some hidden source.  The acoustics in the
cavern are superb, and the simple sound of a water drop hitting the pool
tinkles like the music of a skilled elven bard.  The water is dark, and has a
strong mineral odor, but is probably quite palatable.  Doubtless numerous
denizens of the dark come here to drink.    
~
