#40414
The Great Caverns~
   Looming rocky spires have burst forth from the ground over the centuries
like the teeth of some behemoth intent on devouring you.  The air is hot and
still, and little noise is carried.  The hard rocky ground underfoot holds
little impression of previous travellers, making it hard to guess what may lurk
down here.  Passages stretch into the distance, further in to the darkness.  

