#40426
A Command Post~
   This chamber is dimly lit by luminescent fungi that sprout from small
crevices in the rocky walls, and similar growths that cover the rocks scattered
about the floor.  A broad pillar to the east partially hides a small stairway
that winds upward to the upper level, while a series of bedrolls and blankets
are neatly arranged near the center of this chamber, enabling those who reside
within to keep a lookout in every direction for any intrustion.  Piles of
