A Barracks~
   Several smoking brands light up most of this cavernous chamber, which
contains several piles of cured hides and furs, as well as barrels of wine, ale
and spirits, arranged haphazardly next to an array of dried meats and various
other foodstuffs.  Little of it looks very edible to your eyes.  Hanging from
