A Hound Pit~
   This foul hellhole is literally that, several hell hounds are housed here,
kenneled to serve the giants in times of war or on the hunt, which is usually a
hunt for errant adventurers.  Their keen sense of smell makes them invaluable
for detecting magically concealed foes.  Piles of rotting meat, the remains of
