A Long Tunnel~
   The passage passes into a monstrous tunnel, that stretches away to the south
as far as you can see.  It looks much like the tunnels made by the great worms
of the old deserts, save that it has been bored through solid volcanic rock,
encountering the occasional natural space in the stone.  It is far too large to
