#40450
The Far Side~
   It is with a palpable sense of relief that you finally achieve the far side,
and can turn your back on the precarious bridge that almost spilled you into
the river that warms you even from here.  A short distance to the north you can
see a cavern filled with tables, chairs and maps.  Voices echo all around you,
you apparently have passed into some sort of private headquarters, and will not
be welcome!    
~
