#40475
A Very Small Tunnel~
   This tunnel is cramped and narrow, allowing no more than two or three
creatures to move through at any one time.  Strange growths cover the jagged
walls, which tear at clothing and skin when you accidentally bump into them
during this difficult journey.  You sense something else about this tunnel,
something wicked...    
